		(property "Comment" "RUN/PROGRAM slide switch replacing JP2+JP4. Pos1=RUN (BUCK_5V->+5V, PD_CFG1->GND), pos2=middle=all open, pos3=PROGRAM (VBUS_PD->+5V, PD_CFG1->PD_VDD). Through-hole, hand/wave solder. Pad pairing 1&8/2&7/3&6 inferred from EasyEDA symbol: VERIFY ON REAL PART. JP3 is NOT linked: set JP3 by hand (1-2 RUN, 2-3 PROGRAM)."
